eat local bakery. Worth supporting. I'm going to try their pizza next time.. I will definitely go back."},{"business_id":"dmylotBWcIExhwyyft5bIw","review_id":"RyenhV_IuVTWgvsNBOmuNA","date":"2021-01-26T22:01:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9342372417449951,"text_excerpt":"Full disclosure, I have a friend who works here, so you.could say I'm biased and I would be ok with that. Having said that, this place is awesome. At the beginning of the pandemic I was getting bread from here about once a week. And it was delicious. I also had the cookies, and also delicious. The most recent trip I've had there was for their (relatively) new pizza menu. Easily some of the best pizza in the city. Thin crust, big slices, great cheese and sauce, and good selection of toppings. I'm a pepperoni fan and theirs is fantastic. Go! Right now!!!"},{"business_id":"dmylotBWcIExhwyyft5bIw","review_id":"QfGYgcEGs_bDCOkz6bYrCA","date":"2021-06-06T15:17:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9228499531745911,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in on a rainy Saturday afternoon for a coffee (which was great) and to check out the bakery items. The owners were extremely friendly and explained all of their offerings - sourdough, pizza, sandwiches, baked goods. There was a very large, nice looking selection and I'll be back to try some of it when I'm actually hungry! You do go up a small set of stairs to get to the bakery, so I am not sure if it has a handicap accessible entrance or not."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dmylotBWcIExhwyyft5bIw","photo_id":"nK_jtF5X_uEfuRs04eP_NA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nK_jtF5X_uEfuRs04eP_NA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8571326732635498},{"business_id":"dmylotBWcIExhwyyft5bIw","photo_id":"ZHnnLRwgyh9Lk0-ak3C6ug","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ZHnnLRwgyh9Lk0-ak3C6ug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8571325540542603}]},"notebook_case":null}
